mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与红帽等联合推进OCE1.0研发，打造面向AI代理的“企业级Kubernetes”</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌向免费用户开放 Gemini Skills，Gems 功能将于 11 月完成整合</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3dd79068710eb030bec9c04638f92175.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式宣布将此前仅限 Pro 和 Ultra 付费订阅用户使用的 Gemini Skills 自定义指令服务，全面向所有免费账户用户开放。此次功能迭代旨在降低个性化 AI 的使用门槛，提升 Gemini 在大众消费市场的竞争力。在系统整合方面，原有的 Gems 功能将于 2026 年 11 月 17 日自动过渡并整合至升级后的 Skills 系统中。升级后的 Skills 优化了底层交互逻辑，用户在主聊天框输入斜杠（/）加对应指令即可唤醒特定 AI 技能。对于免费用户，系统支持完整保留既有自定义配置，并可通过专属链接创建新 Skills，确保在迁移期间实现无缝衔接。此次调整不仅提升了操作的直观性与高效性，也标志着谷歌进一步推动 AI 定制化能力的普及，通过降低使用门槛增强平台用户粘性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软联手哈佛MIT发布生物学世界模型Project Quine，加速药物筛选</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/049dadf42e5f697b56c1bd53c8e01875.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软研究院联合哈佛大学及麻省理工学院博德研究所，正式推出生物学世界模型Project Quine。该系统旨在打通计算生物学建模与湿实验流程，通过构建覆盖基因组学、蛋白质、化学分子、细胞状态及生物成像的联合表征空间，实现跨模态综合分析。Project Quine的核心优势在于其交互式推理框架，能够统一处理多领域生物学数据，解决传统药物发现中各学科信息孤岛问题。在实际测试中，该系统展现出极高效率，曾在一个周末内成功筛选出抗癌候选物，将药物筛选与验证周期从数月压缩至数天，显著降低研发成本。目前，微软已启动首届Quine Fellows项目，开放科研人员申请抢先使用该系统，后续计划逐步推进至商业化应用场景。此举标志着世界模型技术在生命科学领域的深度落地，有望大幅缩短新药研发路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ab7742c19edc16283651a5f2488dbbf0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏损超80亿、算力承诺546亿:Anthropic招股书揭开大模型顶流的真实账本AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202658Anthropic近日向部分合作伙伴披露其IPO招股说明书，计划以约2万亿美元的目标估值推进上市。数据显示，公司2025年营收同比增长12倍至近46亿美元，近三分之二来自美国市场，但同期运营亏损亦翻倍突破80亿美元。在商业化结构上，Claude模型以用量计费为主导，贡献约38亿美元收入，订阅业务仅实现7.89亿美元（占比不足20%）。招股书清晰显现出其对头部科技巨头的深度绑定:2025年，Anthropic通过亚马逊和谷歌云平台斩获21.6亿美元收入，营收占比由2023年的11%大幅攀升至47%，并为此支付约3.51亿美元渠道抽成。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与红帽等联合推进OCE1.0研发，打造面向AI代理的“企业级Kubernetes”</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与红帽等联合推进OCE1.0研发，打造面向AI代理的“企业级Kubernetes”AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Sep 30, 202651OpenAI、红帽（Red Hat）与英伟达等多方正联合开发开源智能体框架的企业级版本OpenClaw Enterprise（OCE1.0），旨在消除政企客户对自主 AI 代理的安全顾虑，该项目在社区中被定位为“面向代理的 Kubernetes”。该项目最初由 OpenAI 内部发起，现已捐赠给 OpenClaw 基金会统筹。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">AMD CEO苏姿丰下月访韩，拟与三星电子敲定HBM4内存供应合作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4913ccd3981ba570d2bd86e12ae78ac2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">AMD CEO苏姿丰计划于下月亲赴韩国，与三星电子高层举行会谈，核心议题聚焦于AI芯片技术合作，重点在于敲定三星作为AMD下一代AI加速器HBM4的内存供应商。双方此前已于今年3月签署围绕AI存储芯片与计算技术的谅解备忘录，此次访问旨在将优先供应意向转化为正式订单。HBM4作为AI加速器的关键内存层级，其供应稳定性直接决定了AMD未来旗舰芯片的产能与交付节奏。除三星外，苏姿丰此行还将接触韩国本土NPU企业，意在通过整合内存与专用计算单元，进一步强化AMD在AI算力产业链的布局。此次合作若达成，将标志着三星正式跻身AMD AI加速器核心内存供应链，有助于AMD提升对下一代高性能计算产品命脉的掌控力。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
